<title>NETHERLANDS: Aegon sees 5 pct increase in 1998 EPS.</title>
<headline>Aegon sees 5 pct increase in 1998 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch insurer Aegon NV said on Monday the deal to buy the insurance activities of U.S. Providian Corp could increase earnings in 1998 by around five percent.</p>
<p>&quot;In the first full year, 1998, the increase in earnings per share because of the deal might be around five percent,&quot; an Aegon spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Earlier the company announced it would buy Providian's insurance arm in a deal worth $3.5 billion.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
